commit e5d6cfb182b24f460de44990991b6fe32bc74414
Author: Aleksandr Beshkenadze <beshkenadze@gmail.com>
Date:   Fri Aug 14 21:22:38 2026 +0300

    Add TranslateGemma support (Gemma 3 translation template) (#348)
    
    Add TranslateGemma support (Gemma 3 fine-tune) with its own chat template.
    
    - `TranslateGemma3MessageGenerator` keys turns on source_lang_code/target_lang_code from `UserInput.additionalContext`; falls back to default generator when codes are absent.
    - `ModelConfiguration.messageGenerator` lets a preset override its model's default generator (propagated through `ResolvedModelConfiguration`, honored in both `LLMModelFactory` and `VLMModelFactory`, wrapped via `MessageGeneratorUserInputProcessor` for VLM processors). Scopes the translation template to just the translategemma presets instead of all Gemma 3 text models.
    - `LLMRegistry` presets for translategemma 4b/12b/27b (4bit/8bit).
    - `Gemma3TextConfiguration` fields made public for test introspection; hand-written `ModelConfiguration.==` (type identity for the generator existential).
    - Unit tests + `scripts/translategemma_reference.sh`.
    
    Usage: `UserInput(chat: [.user(text)], additionalContext: ["source_lang_code": "en", "target_lang_code": "fr"])`.

