commit 0b47e6983d86be80cbb111fad796e2a3023435b2
Author: Cassie Spiral <166543307+angelsbrood@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Tue Aug 11 15:46:14 2026 -0700

    Remove the untyped staged-cache fallback (#526)
    
    Make presentation require staged K/V arrays, which are the only valid dtype source when the live rotating cache is empty. Remove the unreachable float32 fallback and pin dtype and shape for the first bfloat16 presentation.
    
    Co-authored-by: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

